<p>Stairs get more traffic than any other part of the house, and they're one of the first things people see when they walk in. We renovate interior staircases, often taking them from tired carpet to wood, and we build new exterior stairs and landings for decks, patios and back doors. Zanini Renovations has been a fully insured carpentry business in Carleton Place since 2020, working across Lanark County and Ottawa.</p>

